{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在日本一所大學教民法的木村，每年開的課通常有400人修，最多時逼近1,000人，學校甚至告訴他，找不到能容納所有學生的教室。</p><p>看他上課總是一臉開心，很難想像他其實不擅長當眾說話。站上講台近30年，木村至今上台依然會緊張。</p><p>相關文章：溝通技巧｜總在當話題終結者？說話有這9個習慣　留不住別人耳朵</p><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506953042759680529730.jpeg/HkRXNJzA-Cx2ChPgDQwZoYZx-q9qd2PlD1hk9A9YZPQ\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506955760799744643917.jpeg/dxpwCxvgGXsdZH1wCC6wdxSHTGwAHJHfsZBf6LGQX-g\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506958382370816691504.jpeg/kqZYA4LQDJanxJgDOnK79nlDzF-blQgFGwP8uhsD_Lo\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506960613871616743605.jpeg/SJhkHc-wwXsYDPYMnM8N_qzr2loZnw_haCWVNmgllTY\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506963055087616137029.jpeg/qmCZEOCxZT5DzuOQ8IqEr2n8rIIN313qiGIDIYhiAyE\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506965492109312501874.jpeg/ytCTJRN331-aTKM7WiL95Vu6U_tzK7VN3J4279yeNu8\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506967987851264405183.jpeg/PMcJ2hQ0w8tHDyxRQTx00RFUL4bNIjEMIyAaHiMgGh4\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506970131271680730248.jpeg/8_NrG0YfNCRwffIFI9OvBmAiqiTaswFsc3NnZXNzZ2U\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506971951730688081679.jpeg/BRP0-mbPA15hnJdVPzFK5VMcbVrVzkp3ZCAXT2QgF08\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506974153871360480216.jpeg/nKygkzmTzjYo6xF8Js5kXYeUjc0pojl_nM7GypzOxso\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506952933707776185203.jpeg/UKeTeuqOUR2S7zDcUw_TeWamrHFwLCMyLryKYS68imE\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506955827908608781635.jpeg/l911FTQUk5YEGEKFKoiyZZQ0OYJilmx752IsPediLD0\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506958340427776039216.jpeg/_s4wni04ERioxwMD9wE6LX1WOP7jwaen6o8yEOqPMhA\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506960462876672014273.jpeg/oju5PwaN2Sk_BrDoiKDIclwE-DvLRu9_Vky-m1ZMvps\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506962866343936038127.jpeg/kzIG6sa8AUNlinBZFrjKcpxKybd1oXqgWsawyVrGsMk\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506965278199808751423.jpeg/xBK9u01JsnNBoi2q1sDUOIv6WWn0EADh4pEWreKRFq0\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506967568420864593804.jpeg/fshN-b0ouzIt7nK1f2_BaTjLppeqtQYbOsj69DrI-vQ\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506970009636864274015.jpeg/dW9uuzKzh4TwW6ZaLsDAFSm4Ay89yPGM61sedutbHnY\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506972425687040187904.jpeg/wtsoh5KVcjboQMrB8rdUIu2O8wR6kSkQ0QCgCtEAoAo\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506975013703680157849.jpeg/spq6JhVQQcV60rxVgnvjtEUXOzuCFYQBj8dGn4_HRp8\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506953126645760457930.jpeg/oh6-Hi6pfwiFNH03ylkuLE6EgB03jn4oi9V3MYvVdzE\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506955689496576420739.jpeg/tfgsK819cvBr0X8QUlQl8_U3AcLeUlVHiMrqIojK6iI\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506958130712576637095.jpeg/kDTtqPmj5eO9MlJLoIuPfnqUFqFSAj6fXideTF4nXkw\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506976350900224731026.jpeg/ojsZbAUrZYqUsY1OTdR_VTIBUTvD4UmL6cWOZOnFjmQ\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506978494320640923517.jpeg/RsfbAhNgwJGit0Xpje9wI8DKfDt-2H3UTfwBpE38AaQ\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506980784541696910234.jpeg/bPwq5sbxJtuuvQ-1BLr7YH-pSmi01CHMms1n9JrNZ_Q\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506982961516544580491.jpeg/jyNEw0AQJEi5FUrhqulI2zTo8snYvgQVStiBlUrYgZU\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506985889271808037192.jpeg/nSAy7IHNQVPJ7dHgbWE2XDz6_6m0u_FgpUsYDKVLGAw\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506989928517632473016.jpeg/YJL3t4H_xxJ3IhoN6Cg-qfZJ4SDzhIloZUOJEWVDiRE\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220119/560506991975469056625871.jpeg/nb6H_CdVltQN0XHV6n-v-A8zOfjTCAZHbRgaxW0YGsU\"/><figcaption>（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>新手時期常在講台上腦袋空白，近30年後他找到的解方是「準備」</p><p>木村剛當老師時，情況更糟。他回想新手時期的狀態：「一站上講台就緊張，腦袋一片空白」、「話總是沒辦法照自己想的說出來」、「搞不清楚該按什麼順序講，沒辦法好好說明」。</p><p>下課後，他常想著「又搞砸了⋯⋯」而陷入沮喪，新手時期就在這樣的循環中度過。</p><p>木村一邊失敗、一邊摸索，在講台上站了超過25年，終於得出一個結論：「緩解當眾說話緊張的最大對策，就是『周全的事前準備』。」</p><p>那麼，具體該準備些什麼？</p><p>從事前準備到站上講台，5個做法讓緊張時也能開口</p><p>把筆記做足，連學生可能的提問都先想好</p><p>木村會把授課資料做得相當紮實，他稱之為「授課筆記」。他會事先具體想像授課時的各種環節，例如：</p><p>「要講什麼、按什麼順序講、講到哪裡為止」</p><p>「要寫哪些板書、搭配什麼說明」</p><p>「學生可能提出哪些問題或疑問」</p><p>他花這麼多力氣準備，是為了減少站上講台時「怎麼辦」的不安。</p><p>準備再周全，課堂也不一定照計畫走。學生可能丟出意想不到的問題，話題也可能偏離預期。木村認為，正因如此才更要準備。</p><p>準備充分的話，即使遇到意外，也會覺得「憑過去累積的知識和經驗，應付得來」。如此一來，就不會過度緊張，也能冷靜應對。</p><blockquote><p>對我來說，準備的目的不只是消除意外，而是建立就算出了意外，也能覺得『沒問題，總有辦法』的自信。</p></blockquote><figure><img alt=\"理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241115/934162045903835136267319.jpeg/zDVYknpCintWEN5eXZis5n6hNeW8yYC8iHfEGIh3xBg\"/><figcaption>理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241115/934162047896260608435092.jpeg/yXXEbssefcRzPnoXhGuKm74WVzxr8QXrIFr67CBa-uw\"/><figcaption>理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241115/934162049695748096278354.jpeg/2nDtkCxi5AKXpcsYtrusP1H6WZggnp3eAbzylgG88pY\"/><figcaption>理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241115/934162051365212160428501.jpeg/RhdUtyTINaqy30qupZiO5s1BKANz1xDTwyY8gsMmPII\"/><figcaption>理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"理財｜有錢人才有的9個金錢觀念！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241115/934162053416357888759432.jpeg/8HL5sHlIjxD6uVxmKbHIghmKV17nix4PEP7mLBD-5iw\"/><figcaption>理財｜有錢人